Zephyr 4.5 ships Mbed TLS 4 with TF-PSA-Crypto, where the legacy crypto APIs
the Toit VM core calls (bignum, SHA, AES, GCM, ChaCha-Poly, ECDSA, entropy)
are private: declared only with MBEDTLS_DECLARE_PRIVATE_IDENTIFIERS, in
mbedtls/private/*.h. These headers forward the old names there, so the VM
sources build unchanged on Zephyr 4.5. Used only when
CONFIG_MBEDTLS_VERSION_4_x (CMakeLists.txt); the conf is zephyr/crypto_mbedtls4.conf.
